@startuml media-states
!theme plain

[*] --> PENDING_UPLOAD : upload ticket issued
PENDING_UPLOAD --> PROCESSING : owner completes upload,\nsize and checksum match
PENDING_UPLOAD --> EXPIRED : ticket not used within 15 min
PROCESSING --> PROCESSING : retry after a transient error
PROCESSING --> READY : all variants written,\nmalware scan clean
PROCESSING --> REJECTED : unsupported file or\nmalware found
PROCESSING --> FAILED : 5 attempts failed
READY --> DELETED : owner deletes the media
REJECTED --> DELETED : owner removes the file
FAILED --> DELETED : owner removes the file
EXPIRED --> [*]
DELETED --> [*] : originals and derivatives purged

@enduml
